                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14911/8.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-11-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is officially stated that the Empress Dowager died yesterday afternoon,
                    2.45.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
